1 + 2 + ... + n = n*(n + 1)/2
1^2 + ... + n^2 = n*(n + 1)*(2*n + 1)/6
1 + q + ... + q^(n-1) = Piecewise((n, Eq(q, 1)), ((q**n - 1)/(q - 1), True))
äärettömästi, q = 1/2: 2
vertailuja: n*(n - 1)/2  n = 1000: 499500
silmukka laskee: 499500
H(10) = 2.928968, ln n + 0.5772 = 2.879785
H(1000) = 7.485471, ln n + 0.5772 = 7.484955
H(1000000) = 14.392727, ln n + 0.5772 = 14.392711
